                    "headRefName": "issue-24-server-walking-skeleton",
                    "baseRefName": "main"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "number": 25,
              "title": "Deploy James on HenkOps at james.jblaak.nl",
              "state": "OPEN",
              "stateReason": null,
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T20:54:20Z",
              "body": "## Parent\n\n#22\n\n## What to build\n\nGet James running on the homelab so it is reachable from anywhere. This spans HenkOps and manual one-time steps, see #18:\n\n- VM 126 on `chilli` (10.10.0.26), 2 cores, 4 GB, Docker\n- Traefik route for `james.jblaak.nl`\n- `op://Homelab/James/*` items, injected with `op run`\n- NFS data dir `/mnt/nfs/james/data`, with ZFS snapshots enabled on `henk_fast/data`\n- `make james` rollout with a `/health` smoke test\n- Share Prive › James (`3f894a15c9a280b2b184e52a5a6e6e04`) with the Notion integration\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] `make james` deploys the latest image and the smoke test passes against `/health`\n- [ ] `https://james.jblaak.nl/health` responds from outside the home network\n- [ ] Secrets come from `op://Homelab/James/*`\n- [ ] The data directory lives on NFS and the share is covered by ZFS snapshots\n- [ ] Prive › James is shared with the Notion integration\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #24\n",
              "repository": {
                "nameWithOwner": "JBlaak/James"
              },
